OL,3,GNEWSARush hour delays on M6 after
OL,4,Avehicle fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FMotorists faced long delays during the
OL,7,Fmorning rush hour due to a vehicle fire
OL,8,Fon a motorway in Cheshire.
OL,10,FThe incident happened on the M6
OL,11,Fsouthbound at J21A M62 J10 Croft
OL,12,FInterchange.
OL,14,FTraffic monitoring service Inrix
OL,15,Freported congestion back to junction 24
OL,16,FAshton-in-Makerfield.
OL,18,FAll lanes have been reopened and the
OL,19,Fcongestion has now cleared, they said.
